{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Inspector Schmidt - The Ebbing artbook gives an insight into our drawings and artwork that have been created, integrated, rethought, discarded, updated, reimagined and most importantly loved by the Active Fungus team. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Contents:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Character Art:</strong> Almost all of our characters have a hand-drawn portrait. The artbook gives an overview of all important characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Choose your own adventure scenes:</strong> Our favourite drawings from the dialogue parts of The Ebbing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Concept Art:</strong> We've included a few milestones from the first sketches to the final key artwork.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3639910?t=1745408479","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639910/ecb508e7712fede1847ab834a04aeb2c96c00f7b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745408479","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639910/8513699da03b4ae81eb57eb20d8dfebac2ab150c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745408479","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639910/8513699da03b4ae81eb57eb20d8dfebac2ab150c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745408479","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Inspector Schmidt - The Ebbing artbook gives an insight into our drawings and artwork that have been created, integrated, rethought, discarded, updated, reimagined and most importantly loved by the Active Fungus team. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Contents:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Character Art:</strong> Almost all of our characters have a hand-drawn portrait. The artb